# Netlify reads this file; Cloudflare reads it too but ignores both rules
# that used to be here:
#  - "/*  /index.html  200" (SPA fallback) loops on Cloudflare. Cloudflare
#    already serves index.html for unknown paths (wrangler.jsonc
#    not_found_handling: "single-page-application"; Pages does this by
#    default), and Netlify gets the same fallback from netlify.toml.
#  - www → apex redirects need a full domain, which these files don't
#    support on Cloudflare. Use a Redirect Rule in the Cloudflare dashboard
#    (Rules → Redirect Rules → "Redirect from WWW to root"). netlify.toml
#    still handles it on Netlify.
